---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ProjectCard from "../components/ProjectCard.astro";
import { projects } from "../data/projects";

const featured = projects.filter((p) => p.featured);
---

<Base>
  <section>
    <h1>Andrew Miller</h1>
    <p class="lede">Backend software engineer. Kotlin first, fintech risk systems, and side projects under Hyphen Labs LLC.</p>
    <p>
      For four years I worked on the risk platform at EarnIn, an earned-wage-access fintech. I built the
      Kotlin and gRPC services that decide how much a member can cash out and when it gets repaid. I led a
      plan to move traffic off legacy queue processors onto shared services, which retired seven
      deployables. I was also a security champion and an on-call first responder for those services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Kotlin is the language I reach for first. I've also shipped production work in Java, Python, C#, and
      JavaScript, and I use AI tools like Claude Code and Cursor in that day-to-day work. Outside of a day job I
      run <a href="https://hyphenlabsllc.com">Hyphen Labs LLC</a>, a small software studio, where I build
      apps and tools like the ones below.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have a B.S. in Computer Engineering from the University of Cincinnati. I'm looking for remote senior
      backend roles, working on production systems that have to be reliable.
    </p>
    <p class="cta">
      <a href="/resume/">Resume</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/mille5a9">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewm192">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="mailto:atmiller192@gmail.com">atmiller192@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Selected projects</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {featured.map((project) => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}
    </div>
    <p class="more"><a href="/projects/">All projects →</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .more {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
